// Code signing team. The real team ID is kept out of git: put it in
// Config/Signing.local.xcconfig (git-ignored). For a new machine, copy
// Config/Signing.local.xcconfig.example to Signing.local.xcconfig and set it.
//
// The empty line below is the default. The optional include overrides it when
// the local file exists, so a fresh clone still builds for the simulator.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
